l"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">浮生若朝露</p>\n <p>我堂堂炮灰，会亿点技能很合理吧</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/67155.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">秃头贝</p>\n <p>我的能力是修改文字描述</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/52422.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">白露未晞yz</p>\n <p>据说秦始皇是个女儿控来着</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class="box">\n <div class="title"><a href="/top/goodnum/">热门收藏</a></div>\n <div class="vote">\n <a href="/shu/93531.html">\n <span class="layui-badge">1</span>\n <img src="https://img.110txt.com/93531/1784652.jpg" alt="恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场">\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p>\n <p class="intro" style="display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 4;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;">沈棠一觉醒来穿成了三百斤的大胖子，却拥有五个绝色兽夫。\n美艳红狐，霸道黑豹，阴郁白蛇，人鱼暴君，硬汉金鹰上将……各个宽肩窄腰大长腿，八块腹肌堪比男模！\n原主又丑又懒遭人嫌，兽夫们避如蛇蝎，她还妄图霸王硬上弓，穿越过来的沈棠成了这个替罪羔羊。\n开局便是修罗场！面对兽夫冰冷、厌恶的目光，沈棠吓得浑身发抖</p>\n </a>\n </div>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1628.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-orange">2</span>\n <p class="bookname">二次成年</p>\n <p class="author">俏不争</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/5357.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-green">3</span>\n <p class="bookname">神秘复苏</p>\n <p class="author">佛前献花</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/615.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-blue">4</span>\n <p class="bookname">神话降临：从抓捕超凡开始无敌</p>\n <p class="author">油炸鱿鱼串</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/595.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-cyan">5</span>\n <p class="bookname">死后的我成了土地神</p>\n <p class="author">莫慌淡定</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/442.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">6</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生大佬种田开挂养萌娃</p>\n <p class="author">彩虹坡</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1382.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">我真没想破案啊</p>\n <p class="author">尘埃落定事件簿</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/652.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">8</span>\n <p class="bookname">新主播时代</p>\n <p class="author">水墨珊</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1428.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">9</span>\n <p class="bookname">韩先生情谋已久</p>\n <p class="author">恍若晨曦</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1374.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">10</span>\n <p class="bookname">仙子你道侣又换人设了</p>\n <p class="author">神棍</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/566.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">11</span>\n <p class="bookname">从紫云养气诀开始</p>\n <p class="author">云遥玄莫</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/256.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">12</span>\n <p class="bookname">这个大夫画风清奇却举世无敌</p>\n <p class="author">辰时岁月</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/537.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">13</span>\n <p class="bookname">我，沙盒玩家，从聊斋世界开始</p>\n <p class="author">幽冥潜龙</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1328.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">14</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生之文豪崛起</p>\n <p class="author">汪公子在年</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1280.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">15</span>\n <p class="bookname">在斗罗大陆不讲武德</p>\n <p class="author">笔名不许空</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>\n<form action="/search.html" method="post" class="search">\n\t\t<span><i class="layui-icon i_search"></i><i class="layui-icon i_cancel"></i><input type="text" name="searchkey" placeholder="请输入搜索内容！" /></span>\n\t\t<button class="layui-btn">搜索</button>\n\t</form>\n<div class="footer">\n<p><a href="/shuku/">书库</a> <a href="/sort.html">分类</a> <a href="/zuozhe/">作者</a> <a href="/wanben/">全本</a> <a href="/top/">排行</a></p>\n<p><a href="ht